# LF-RISKROSI Delivery Phase Status

> This status replaces the historical checklist that marked the platform production-ready. It is a repository-level implementation review, not a signed product requirements document or compliance attestation.

## Phase plan provenance

No approved, versioned Phase 0–9 plan or acceptance contract is present in the repository. Phase 0 is a proposed baseline reconstructed from current functionality and user-provided product direction; phases 5–9 are retrospective groupings for visibility. Phases 1–4 retain headings from the earlier checklist, but its completion claims were not supported by the current source tree.

## Phase 0: Baseline and scope — partial sign-off recorded; acceptance pending

This section records the user's Phase 0 sign-off declarations received on 2026-10-28, including subsequent user-reported Product Owner and legal/privacy approvals by Rockey. It is not a signed document from the named individuals and does not include supporting deployment, legal, or operational evidence. Treat approvals as user-reported until their scope and evidence are attached; do not infer that a code-level control or compliance obligation has been satisfied.

