- Node unit tests passed: 44 tests, rerun on 2026-10-29.
- Go agent tests passed; Windows and Linux agent cross-builds passed.
- Prisma schema validation passed, rerun on 2026-10-29.
- All checked-in migrations applied to a fresh PostgreSQL database.
- Next.js production build passed.
- Docker Compose default and monitoring-profile configuration validation passed; the monitoring services have not been verified running.
- Latest environment check: C: had approximately 72 MB free; PostgreSQL's container health check was healthy, while Redis was unhealthy and `/api/health` returned HTTP 503 with both dependency checks false. Docker Desktop storage previously reported read-only errors. No volumes were removed.

These are local code/build checks only. They do not prove production security, compliance, availability, data residency, or effective endpoint enforcement.

## Overall status

**Not production-ready.** Complete Phase 0 requirements and deployment gates, implement and independently validate the missing operational/security controls, and define acceptance evidence before making a production-readiness claim.
